OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve project gets
OL,4,Alottery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project connecting local people to
OL,7,Ftheir natural landscapes has been
OL,8,Fawarded almost #90,000.
OL,10,FThe funds were awarded to Baildon Town
OL,11,FCouncil to create a new exhibition at
OL,12,FBracken Hall Countryside Centre about
OL,13,Fthe Bradford Pennine Gateway National
OL,14,FNature Reserve (NNR).
OL,16,FThe NNR, created in May 2025, was the
OL,17,Ffirst in West Yorkshire and includes
OL,18,Fsites such as Baildon Moor, Shipley
OL,19,FGlen, Trench Meadows and Baildon Bank.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
